# Arcade physics

When changing **driving physics**, race feel, Eigenschaften→forces, grip/slide, handling, nitro, brakes, jumps, mass shove, walls/obstacles contact, or car base/part stats that feed the sim:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/arcade-physics/SKILL.md` (and `stat-map.md` / `evolution.md` as needed)
2. Also read `.cursor/skills/clean-programming/` for any code change
3. If CONCEPT §4 rules move, also follow `.cursor/skills/game-concept/`
4. Evolve deliberately — failing feel test → smallest fix → log evolution.md → version/commit/push
